#
# ---
# Heavily opinionated debloat script.
#
# Only preserves the ability to use Google login and gives no guarantees for
# anything else. Notable breakage:
# - Most/all Samsung essential smartphone apps, such as 'Phone'.
# - Most Samsung functions, such as any Knox-related ones.
# - (Maybe) Samsung account/login.
# - Some diagnostics and stock diagnostic apps/menus.
# - (Maybe) Some inessential (privacy risk) stock Camera functions.
# - Some built-in wallpapers & theming.
# - Battery stats & modes.
#
# Also, all Google apps (even Play Store), except GMS, will be removed.
#
# It is therefore assumed that you have already installed FOSS alternatives
# from F-Droid to substitute for any breakage; *I* did, and I am not missing
# anything essential.
# ---
